In infra/modules/container_apps/main.tf, every "secret" block currently has a 
key_vault_secret_id hardcoded to the domain "https://primaryddevkv.vault.azure.net/", 
for example:

  key_vault_secret_id = "https://primaryddevkv.vault.azure.net/secrets/neo4j-password"

Replace every occurrence of the hardcoded domain "https://primaryddevkv.vault.azure.net/" 
with "${var.key_vault_uri}" so the line above becomes:

  key_vault_secret_id = "${var.key_vault_uri}secrets/neo4j-password"

Do this for all secret blocks in the file (there are approximately 6). 

Then, in infra/modules/container_apps/variables.tf, add this new variable declaration, 
placed near the other variables (after the "location" variable):

variable "key_vault_uri" {
  type        = string
  description = "URI of the Key Vault to pull secrets from (e.g. https://<name>.vault.azure.net/)."
}

Do NOT change anything else in either file — no other hardcoded values, no scaling 
settings, no ACR or Cosmos or Doc Intelligence references. Only the key_vault_secret_id 
lines and the new variable declaration.
